
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Manga Library - Git & Version Control</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 35px 20px;
            background: #151525;
            color: #f1f1f1;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            padding: 40px;
            background: #23233a;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #393957;
            border-radius: 16px;
        }

        header p {
            color: #aaaac2;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: #a78bfa;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        header .eyebrow {
            color: #c4b5fd;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 38px;
            color: #a78bfa;
        }

        section {
            margin-top: 22px;
            padding: 28px;
            background: #23233a;
            border: 1px solid #393957;
            border-radius: 14px;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        section:hover {
            border-color: #7c3aed;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 6px 0 12px;
            font-size: 23px;
            color: #c4b5fd;
        }

        section p:not(.eyebrow) {
            color: #aaaac2;
        }

        .links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .links a {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 16px;
            background: #7c3aed;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .links a:hover {
            background: #6d28d9;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #8888a5;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                padding: 28px 22px;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            section {
                padding: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<main>

    <header>
        <p class="eyebrow">GACHON UNIVERSITY · COMPUTER SCIENCE</p>
        <h1>Git & Version Control</h1>
        <p>November 6, 2026 · Week 10 Assignment</p>
        <p>Learning repository management and collaborative development.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL PROJECT</p>
        <h2>My Developer Portfolio</h2>
        <p>
            Built a personal portfolio to introduce myself, present my
            technical skills, and showcase projects completed during
            my Web Programming course.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/ERDENETSOGT-DELGERBAT/portfolio"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                View Portfolio Repository →
            </a>

            <a href="https://erdenetsogt-delgerbat.github.io/portfolio/"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Visit Portfolio Website →
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL WORK · E1–E3</p>
        <h2>Git and GitHub Practice</h2>
        <p>
            Practiced essential Git commands, including creating
            repositories, tracking files, making commits, and managing
            branches.
        </p>
        <p>
            Also learned how to merge changes and publish a project
            using GitHub Pages.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://erdenetsogt-delgerbat.github.io/webpro-w9/"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Open Git Exercises →
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <p class="eyebrow">REPOSITORY PROJECT</p>
        <h2>Web Programming Assignments</h2>
        <p>
            Created a GitHub repository to organize and publish
            HTML, CSS, and JavaScript assignments from the
            Web Programming course.
        </p>
        <p>
            Used GitHub Pages to make the project accessible
            through a public website.
        </p>

        <div class="links">
            <a href="https://github.com/ERDENETSOGT-DELGERBAT/webpro-w9"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                View Source Code →
            </a>

            <a href="https://erdenetsogt-delgerbat.github.io/webpro-w9/"
               target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                View Live Website →
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Chingun · Gachon University</p>
        <p>Web Programming | Git & Version Control</p>
    </footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
